---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Section from '../Section.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../SectionHeading.astro';
import libraryImage from '../../assets/library.jpg';
---

<Section id="about" class="bg-porcelain py-24 md:py-32 lg:py-40">
  <SectionHeading number="05">
    My path began on the water.
  </SectionHeading>

  <div class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 gap-y-12 lg:mt-20">
    <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5">
      <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden lg:aspect-[3/4]" data-reveal-scale>
        <Image
          src={libraryImage}
          alt="Floor-to-ceiling shelves of well-kept books in a private library"
          widths={[640, 960, 1440]}
          sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 38vw, 100vw"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-sapphire/20 mix-blend-multiply"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7" data-reveal>
      <p class="max-w-xl font-serif text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-ink/85 md:text-2xl">
        For many years, I worked as a boat captain, navigating vessels where precision, foresight, and
        responsibility were not optional — they were the standard.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 max-w-xl space-y-6 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/70">
        <p>
          Managing mechanical systems, crews, logistics, and the quiet expectations of ownership taught me
          discipline, adaptability, and an unwavering attention to detail. I was pursuing a captain&rsquo;s
          position aboard private yachts when an unexpected opportunity arose on land — a different kind of
          vessel to steward. What I often call the &ldquo;land yacht&rdquo; became my next chapter.
        </p>
        <p>
          Estate and property management felt like a natural evolution. The scale changed, but the principles
          remained: protection of assets, operational excellence, thoughtful oversight, and hands-on leadership.
          From full property transformations and ground-up builds to landscape design, budgeting, vendor
          coordination, and long-term maintenance, I am present in every layer of the work.
        </p>
        <p class="font-serif text-lg font-light italic text-ink/80">
          To me, estate management is stewardship — ensuring that beauty, function, and value move in quiet
          harmony.
        </p>
      </div>

      <dl class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 border-t border-ink/15 pt-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <dt class="eyebrow text-gold-dark">Foresight</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Solving problems before they appear.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="eyebrow text-gold-dark">Integrity</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/65">An unwavering standard of excellence.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="eyebrow text-gold-dark">Stewardship</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Hands-on leadership, in every layer of the work.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
